# `project` (renamed and computed), `project-away`, `project-rename` and `extend` (replacing in place,
# and reading an earlier item) run end to end.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| where amount > 200
| project id = orderId, customerId, amount, cents = amount * 100
| project-away customerId
| project-rename total = amount
| extend total = total * 2, big = total > 400
| take 3
---- expected
id     | total | cents   | big
string | real  | real    | bool
-------+-------+---------+-----
o-0006 | 503.5 | 25175.0 | true
o-0028 | 491.5 | 24575.0 | true
o-0029 | 411.0 | 20550.0 | true
